; The macOS service's fixed-path launcher (digestif_launcher.ml, docs/releases.md, The launcher).
;
; The node binary embeds this executable's bytes beside a digest of this directory's source
; (update/lib, launcher_data.ml), and writes them to <data dir>/launcher/Digestif only when that
; digest differs from the one installed there, so the bytes macOS keys a privacy grant to change
; only when this source does. That is sound only while nothing outside this directory reaches
; these bytes: the standard library and unix, and nothing of the node's. DIG-492

(executable
 (name digestif_launcher)
 (modules digestif_launcher)
 (libraries unix))
